1
00:01:30,566 --> 00:01:31,551
=Tigers Sniff the Rose=

2
00:01:31,551 --> 00:01:33,560
(Based on the novel of the same name by Yiren Kuikui)

3
00:01:35,260 --> 00:01:38,940
=Episode 23=

4
00:01:40,620 --> 00:01:41,740
A little stone stele

5
00:01:41,740 --> 00:01:43,260
hardly conveys my sincerity.

6
00:01:43,940 --> 00:01:44,900
I've already ordered

7
00:01:45,260 --> 00:01:47,780
my 100,000 Central Circuit troops
at the border

8
00:01:50,020 --> 00:01:51,180
to join me in wishing Your Majesty

9
00:01:51,820 --> 00:01:53,140
a long and prosperous reign.

10
00:01:53,340 --> 00:01:53,900
This...

11
00:01:54,540 --> 00:01:55,020
How...

12
00:02:10,700 --> 00:02:11,900
General, I appreciate

13
00:02:13,100 --> 00:02:14,020
the gesture.

14
00:02:17,340 --> 00:02:18,540
Forgive my boldness, Your Majesty.

15
00:02:24,980 --> 00:02:25,860
May I

16
00:02:26,420 --> 00:02:27,460
take a look at that tablet?

17
00:02:31,580 --> 00:02:32,060
Your Majesty,

18
00:02:33,340 --> 00:02:34,020
perhaps

19
00:02:35,100 --> 00:02:37,020
we should let Scholar Yan have a try.

20
00:02:38,020 --> 00:02:38,380
Very well.

21
00:02:42,020 --> 00:02:42,340
Yan Shang!

22
00:02:54,500 --> 00:02:55,940
The inscription on General Meng's tablet

23
00:02:56,460 --> 00:02:58,420
has faded with age.

24
00:02:59,060 --> 00:02:59,700
However,

25
00:03:00,260 --> 00:03:02,620
I've studied regional scripts
since childhood

26
00:03:02,980 --> 00:03:03,740
and know a little about them.

27
00:03:04,340 --> 00:03:04,860
Perhaps

28
00:03:05,700 --> 00:03:07,220
I could try reading it aloud.

29
00:03:09,540 --> 00:03:09,980
Your Majesty,

30
00:03:10,900 --> 00:03:11,540
why not

31
00:03:12,660 --> 00:03:15,180
let the third-place scholar
give it a try?

32
00:03:17,820 --> 00:03:18,180
Very well.

33
00:03:32,060 --> 00:03:33,180
No wonder General Meng said

34
00:03:33,180 --> 00:03:34,860
this tablet was a hundred years old.

35
00:03:35,820 --> 00:03:36,500
He was right.

36
00:03:37,420 --> 00:03:37,900
This is

37
00:03:38,580 --> 00:03:40,140
an imperial edict from a century ago,

38
00:03:40,420 --> 00:03:43,420
issued by Emperor Shengzu,
founder of Huai.

39
00:03:51,580 --> 00:03:53,340
"Compared to Huai,

40
00:03:54,300 --> 00:03:55,260
the Central Circuit is
but a single prefecture.

41
00:03:55,980 --> 00:03:58,700
You should respect our might
and appreciate our mercy,

42
00:03:58,900 --> 00:04:00,140
and seek peace rather than conflict.

43
00:04:00,700 --> 00:04:02,300
Otherwise, when our imperial army
marches,

44
00:04:02,500 --> 00:04:03,620
blood will flow for miles.

45
00:04:04,380 --> 00:04:06,660
Our emperor, in his boundless mercy,

46
00:04:07,300 --> 00:04:08,660
has forgiven your insolence.

47
00:04:09,260 --> 00:04:09,900
You would

48
00:04:10,740 --> 00:04:11,700
do well to think twice!"

49
00:04:14,260 --> 00:04:15,420
Brilliant!

50
00:04:15,540 --> 00:04:16,460
Absolutely...

51
00:04:16,860 --> 00:04:17,820
Absolutely brilliant!

52
00:04:17,820 --> 00:04:18,940
What a joke!

53
00:04:25,420 --> 00:04:27,620
Back then, the Meng ancestors
pledged allegiance and paid tribute.

54
00:04:27,820 --> 00:04:29,700
That's when Emperor Shengzu
issued this edict.

55
00:04:30,060 --> 00:04:33,180
He even displayed their letter
of surrender atop Shenwu Gate.

56
00:04:33,900 --> 00:04:34,380
Today,

57
00:04:35,020 --> 00:04:36,820
your 100,000 troops are far away
in the Central Circuit,

58
00:04:37,540 --> 00:04:38,540
but that letter of surrender

59
00:04:39,140 --> 00:04:40,700
is right here in Taiji Palace.

60
00:04:41,420 --> 00:04:43,300
Would you care to see it, General Meng?

61
00:04:43,980 --> 00:04:44,620
That won't be necessary.

62
00:04:50,020 --> 00:04:50,460
Enough.

63
00:04:51,420 --> 00:04:53,380
There's no need to bring up the past.

64
00:04:54,020 --> 00:04:56,860
General, don't take it to heart.

65
00:04:57,380 --> 00:04:59,660
Yan, despite your young age,

66
00:05:00,660 --> 00:05:02,980
you're already a scholar
of remarkable learning.

67
00:05:03,660 --> 00:05:04,140
Bring him a seat.

68
00:05:06,060 --> 00:05:07,180
Thank you, Your Majesty.

69
00:05:18,220 --> 00:05:19,300
Could you really read those characters?

70
00:05:20,980 --> 00:05:21,820
Not a single one.

71
00:05:23,820 --> 00:05:24,900
You've got some nerve.

72
00:05:25,260 --> 00:05:27,060
North Jing joined the Central Plains
dynasties ages ago.

73
00:05:27,460 --> 00:05:28,740
They've long shared our language
and script.

74
00:05:29,100 --> 00:05:30,900
Before that, they had a spoken language
but no script.

75
00:05:31,300 --> 00:05:32,380
How could they have a script
of their own?

76
00:05:44,580 --> 00:05:45,020
Your Majesty,

77
00:05:45,740 --> 00:05:47,140
since you're pleased with my gift,

78
00:05:47,860 --> 00:05:49,340
I have another favor to ask.

79
00:05:50,020 --> 00:05:51,020
Go ahead, General.

80
00:05:51,660 --> 00:05:53,620
When Princess Danyang married
into North Jing,

81
00:05:54,420 --> 00:05:56,140
it was a great honor you bestowed
on my uncle.

82
00:05:57,420 --> 00:05:59,340
Now that I've succeeded him as military
governor of the Central Circuit,

83
00:05:59,940 --> 00:06:00,860
I'd like to ask Your Majesty

84
00:06:01,500 --> 00:06:02,780
to grant me the same honor.

85
00:06:03,420 --> 00:06:04,580
General, are you asking...

86
00:06:05,340 --> 00:06:06,580
By North Jing custom,

87
00:06:08,300 --> 00:06:09,460
a wife follows her husband in death,

88
00:06:10,100 --> 00:06:11,140
and a son succeeds his father.

89
00:06:12,180 --> 00:06:13,700
My uncle raised me like his own son.

90
00:06:14,420 --> 00:06:15,300
So I beg Your Majesty

91
00:06:16,140 --> 00:06:18,060
to grant me Princess Danyang's hand.

92
00:06:36,820 --> 00:06:37,300
Father,

93
00:06:38,020 --> 00:06:39,460
since this concerns my marriage,

94
00:06:40,340 --> 00:06:41,380
I have something to say.

95
00:06:42,580 --> 00:06:42,900
Speak.

96
00:06:43,460 --> 00:06:44,620
I'm not opposed to marrying again.

97
00:06:45,300 --> 00:06:47,060
But I spent quite some time
in North Jing,

98
00:06:47,500 --> 00:06:48,500
so I know a few of their customs.

99
00:06:49,300 --> 00:06:50,340
The northerners value martial skill.

100
00:06:51,100 --> 00:06:53,140
A suitor often has to fight
for a bride's hand.

101
00:06:53,620 --> 00:06:55,340
Only the winner earns the right
to marry her.

102
00:06:58,220 --> 00:06:59,220
And whom would you like me

103
00:06:59,620 --> 00:07:01,420
to challenge, Princess Danyang?

104
00:07:02,140 --> 00:07:03,780
It's the perfect time for a hunt.

105
00:07:04,660 --> 00:07:05,900
Since General Meng has made his request,

106
00:07:07,100 --> 00:07:08,300
why not have him compete

107
00:07:09,020 --> 00:07:10,540
with the other suitors here?

108
00:07:11,300 --> 00:07:12,540
Whoever wins,

109
00:07:12,980 --> 00:07:15,140
I'll marry him.

110
00:07:23,180 --> 00:07:23,820
Wanyao,

111
00:07:24,460 --> 00:07:26,060
have you thought this through?

112
00:07:27,540 --> 00:07:28,900
Please grant me this, Father.

113
00:07:32,140 --> 00:07:32,500
Very well.

114
00:07:34,180 --> 00:07:35,540
Winter has been rather dull.

115
00:07:36,500 --> 00:07:37,540
This should liven things up.

116
00:07:38,300 --> 00:07:40,780
Warriors from every territory
may join the hunt.

117
00:07:41,260 --> 00:07:44,060
And if it leads
to an extraordinary marriage,

118
00:07:44,900 --> 00:07:47,060
that would make quite a story.

119
00:07:55,420 --> 00:07:57,260
If you gentlemen truly wish
to compete against me,

120
00:07:58,300 --> 00:07:59,660
I'll gladly accept the challenge.

121
00:08:00,980 --> 00:08:02,740
But there's something
you should know first,

122
00:08:03,180 --> 00:08:05,620
so you won't feel cheated
after the contest

123
00:08:06,420 --> 00:08:07,860
and regret all that effort.

124
00:08:09,300 --> 00:08:10,580
You may not be aware,

125
00:08:11,020 --> 00:08:11,820
but Princess Danyang

126
00:08:13,700 --> 00:08:15,820
once had an abortion in North Jing.

127
00:08:17,980 --> 00:08:18,740
She'll never

128
00:08:19,060 --> 00:08:20,740
be able to bear children again.

129
00:08:34,900 --> 00:08:35,980
Now that you know the truth,

130
00:08:37,860 --> 00:08:39,700
does anyone still want to challenge me?

131
00:08:44,020 --> 00:08:44,380
Your Majesty,

132
00:08:45,100 --> 00:08:47,780
I'd like to challenge General Meng!

133
00:08:50,580 --> 00:08:50,940
Your Majesty,

134
00:08:51,380 --> 00:08:52,140
I'd like to compete too!

135
00:08:52,700 --> 00:08:53,700
Unbelievable!

136
00:08:54,740 --> 00:08:55,780
You're a woman.

137
00:08:56,860 --> 00:08:57,860
You want to marry the Princess too?

138
00:08:58,540 --> 00:08:59,260
I'm not doing this for the Princess.

139
00:09:00,020 --> 00:09:00,660
I'm competing

140
00:09:01,180 --> 00:09:02,260
to show everyone

141
00:09:02,700 --> 00:09:03,980
whether you people of North Jing

142
00:09:04,420 --> 00:09:05,860
are as brave as we are in Sheng'an!

143
00:09:06,020 --> 00:09:06,820
Mind your manners!

144
00:09:09,140 --> 00:09:09,660
General Meng,

145
00:09:10,460 --> 00:09:11,900
my daughter is young and headstrong.

146
00:09:12,380 --> 00:09:13,200
(Zhao Zongze, Zhao Lingfei's Father)
Please don't take offense.

147
00:09:13,200 --> 00:09:14,140
(General of the Left Imperial Guard)
Please don't take offense.

148
00:09:16,420 --> 00:09:16,980
General Zhao,

149
00:09:17,460 --> 00:09:20,380
your daughter has shown
admirable spirit.

150
00:09:20,940 --> 00:09:21,420
Your Majesty,

151
00:09:21,820 --> 00:09:22,900
why not let her compete?

152
00:09:25,660 --> 00:09:26,100
Permission granted.

153
00:09:26,980 --> 00:09:27,460
Your Majesty,

154
00:09:29,380 --> 00:09:31,540
I have a young officer under my command

155
00:09:31,780 --> 00:09:32,980
named Jian Hua.

156
00:09:33,740 --> 00:09:34,860
He's young and handsome,

157
00:09:35,180 --> 00:09:36,140
with exceptional fighting skills.

158
00:09:36,740 --> 00:09:37,900
He'd be a worthy match for the Princess.

159
00:09:38,420 --> 00:09:39,460
(Mu Xianqing, Military Governor)
He could compete as well.

160
00:09:40,140 --> 00:09:40,620
Your Majesty,

161
00:09:42,740 --> 00:09:44,940
(Qiu Shuo, General of Tiger Might)
I'd like to join the winter hunt too!

162
00:09:54,980 --> 00:09:56,740
Since Zhao Lingfei
is allowed to compete,

163
00:09:57,780 --> 00:09:58,980
I suppose this competition

164
00:09:59,580 --> 00:10:00,540
isn't just about marrying Wanyao.

165
00:10:01,780 --> 00:10:03,100
And as Wanyao's older brother,

166
00:10:04,660 --> 00:10:05,820
I'd also like to test

167
00:10:06,620 --> 00:10:07,780
General Meng's fighting skills.

168
00:10:07,980 --> 00:10:08,660
Excellent!

169
00:10:09,980 --> 00:10:12,020
With even the Crown Prince joining us,

170
00:10:12,500 --> 00:10:14,060
whether I win or lose,

171
00:10:14,620 --> 00:10:16,100
this trip will have been worthwhile.

172
00:10:16,420 --> 00:10:17,500
Since it's a competition,

173
00:10:18,340 --> 00:10:20,620
we should establish the rules first.

174
00:10:21,340 --> 00:10:21,940
Why don't we

175
00:10:22,980 --> 00:10:24,780
tie a golden bell around a deer's neck?

176
00:10:25,420 --> 00:10:27,860
All who signed up today will hunt it.

177
00:10:28,300 --> 00:10:29,340
Whoever claims the deer

178
00:10:29,820 --> 00:10:33,020
will decide whom Princess Danyang
marries.

179
00:10:33,700 --> 00:10:34,180
How does that sound?

180
00:10:36,980 --> 00:10:37,500
Father,

181
00:10:38,860 --> 00:10:40,220
it seems I have no choice
but to compete too.

182
00:10:43,780 --> 00:10:45,220
It seems Princess Danyang

183
00:10:45,540 --> 00:10:49,220
is determined to have a say
in her own marriage.

184
00:10:54,980 --> 00:10:55,660
Cheng'an,

185
00:10:56,660 --> 00:10:58,100
let's give her that chance.

186
00:10:59,180 --> 00:11:00,460
As Your Majesty wishes.

187
00:11:02,540 --> 00:11:03,020
Very well.

188
00:11:05,700 --> 00:11:06,660
Ten days from now,

189
00:11:07,020 --> 00:11:08,460
we'll hold a winter hunt
at the royal hunting grounds.

190
00:11:09,020 --> 00:11:11,180
All those who've signed up,

191
00:11:11,380 --> 00:11:13,500
along with the promising young people
of Sheng'an,

192
00:11:13,780 --> 00:11:14,700
may participate.

193
00:11:15,340 --> 00:11:16,420
I'm curious to see

194
00:11:17,340 --> 00:11:17,940
who will

195
00:11:18,980 --> 00:11:19,660
ultimately

196
00:11:21,180 --> 00:11:23,020
claim the deer.

197
00:11:25,460 --> 00:11:27,660
Your Majesty is wise!

198
00:11:43,980 --> 00:11:48,100
♪We weren't born for sacrifice.
Love isn't meant for silent suffering♪

199
00:11:48,300 --> 00:11:50,820
♪Nor wed for the sake of any kingdom♪

200
00:11:50,980 --> 00:11:54,500
♪Cold as a blade,
yet peerless as a bloom♪

201
00:11:54,820 --> 00:11:58,340
♪Who dares make me bow
down in the dust?♪

202
00:11:58,380 --> 00:12:02,620
♪With sacrificed innocence
and a soul snowbound♪

203
00:12:02,740 --> 00:12:05,220
♪If the road is blocked,
I'll fight my way through♪

204
00:12:05,380 --> 00:12:08,460
♪Cut down the crowd,
strike down the proud gods♪

205
00:12:08,580 --> 00:12:11,700
♪Break through Hell's gates♪

206
00:12:12,380 --> 00:12:16,420
♪If I could meet my former self again♪

207
00:12:16,940 --> 00:12:19,740
♪Don't be afraid,
I'll become a demon for you♪

208
00:12:19,820 --> 00:12:26,020
♪Through fire, I'll turn the
dark towers bright as day for you♪

209
00:12:26,660 --> 00:12:30,460
♪Though this world is hard to cross,
I'll lead you through♪

210
00:12:30,580 --> 00:12:33,660
♪I dare face the unknown,
with my sword in hand♪

211
00:12:33,900 --> 00:12:38,120
♪Slay wolves, tame tigers,
breach the city gates♪

212
00:12:38,120 --> 00:12:42,740
♪Slay wolves, tame tigers,
breach the city gates♪

213
00:12:43,540 --> 00:12:47,340
♪They gave me this life
without asking me♪

214
00:12:47,820 --> 00:12:50,900
♪If I can't decide what to do with it♪

215
00:12:51,140 --> 00:12:57,500
♪I might as well use it to light a fire
and burn the darkness into daylight♪

216
00:12:57,860 --> 00:13:01,660
♪You're my princess,
and I'll take you away♪

217
00:13:01,780 --> 00:13:04,860
♪In this life, we'll bow
only to flowers♪

218
00:13:05,100 --> 00:13:10,940
♪Fierce and radiant,
red lips and dark eyes♪

219
00:13:11,220 --> 00:13:15,260
♪Together we'll climb the city walls♪

220
00:13:19,420 --> 00:13:21,780
How can we examine her
if she won't let us in?

221
00:13:21,780 --> 00:13:23,060
We still have to report back!

222
00:13:23,300 --> 00:13:24,100
Exactly!

223
00:13:24,100 --> 00:13:24,580
Of course!

224
00:13:26,260 --> 00:13:26,940
Who's that?

225
00:13:27,660 --> 00:13:28,740
What's he doing here?

226
00:13:28,940 --> 00:13:29,780
No idea.

227
00:13:29,900 --> 00:13:34,080
♪Mourn the blooms of youth;
Mourn my bridal hair♪

228
00:13:34,080 --> 00:13:38,420
♪Mourn the blooms of youth;
Mourn my bridal hair♪

229
00:13:39,700 --> 00:13:40,100
Your Highness.

230
00:13:40,820 --> 00:13:41,340
It's me.

231
00:13:47,460 --> 00:13:47,940
Your Highness.

232
00:14:18,220 --> 00:14:18,700
You're drunk.

233
00:14:51,900 --> 00:14:52,740
Did you see them?

234
00:14:55,020 --> 00:14:55,980
Those people outside

235
00:14:57,180 --> 00:14:58,140
include Lord Yu's men

236
00:14:59,380 --> 00:15:00,340
and the Crown Prince's.

237
00:15:03,100 --> 00:15:04,980
They claim they're here
for a routine checkup.

238
00:15:09,860 --> 00:15:12,340
It's only been a few hours
since Meng Zaishi said those things.

239
00:15:13,460 --> 00:15:14,940
They couldn't even wait one night

240
00:15:15,700 --> 00:15:16,780
to find out if he was telling the truth.

241
00:15:21,460 --> 00:15:21,980
What about you?

242
00:15:23,860 --> 00:15:24,300
Yan Shang.

243
00:15:26,140 --> 00:15:27,380
Don't you have anything
you want to ask me?

244
00:15:55,980 --> 00:15:57,100
There's only one thing I want to ask.

245
00:15:58,900 --> 00:16:00,460
Should we curse Meng Zaishi first,

246
00:16:02,180 --> 00:16:03,340
or your brother?

247
00:16:05,020 --> 00:16:05,900
I'll curse them right along with you.

248
00:16:18,780 --> 00:16:19,780
What he said was true.

249
00:16:25,300 --> 00:16:26,700
I can't have children anymore.

250
00:16:34,860 --> 00:16:35,380
What a coincidence.

251
00:16:37,620 --> 00:16:39,540
A fortune teller once told me,
when I was little,

252
00:16:40,780 --> 00:16:42,580
that I was destined to have no children.

253
00:16:47,740 --> 00:16:49,260
I was worried you'd reject me over it.

254
00:16:50,380 --> 00:16:50,740
Who knew

255
00:16:52,340 --> 00:16:53,660
we'd end up in the same boat?

256
00:17:03,340 --> 00:17:03,740
Your Highness,

257
00:17:05,540 --> 00:17:07,300
I'll never let you marry Meng Zaishi.

258
00:17:09,380 --> 00:17:09,820
All right.

259
00:17:10,940 --> 00:17:12,180
I'll keep rising through the ranks

260
00:17:14,740 --> 00:17:16,620
until I can be your bargaining chip,

261
00:17:19,060 --> 00:17:20,700
so no one can ever control you again.

262
00:17:43,500 --> 00:17:43,940
Yan Shang.

263
00:17:48,580 --> 00:17:49,220
Thank you.

264
00:17:59,020 --> 00:17:59,500
Your Highness,

265
00:18:01,020 --> 00:18:01,780
between you and me,

266
00:18:03,940 --> 00:18:04,500
there's no need for thanks.

267
00:18:11,620 --> 00:18:12,220
Don't worry.

268
00:18:14,580 --> 00:18:15,820
I'll take good care of myself.

269
00:18:20,740 --> 00:18:21,780
(If I could kill once,)

270
00:18:23,060 --> 00:18:24,220
(I can kill again.)

271
00:18:25,900 --> 00:18:26,980
(Meng Zaishi's neck)

272
00:18:27,780 --> 00:18:29,460
(can't be any tougher than his uncle's.)

273
00:18:32,220 --> 00:18:32,980
(But Yan Shang,)

274
00:18:34,540 --> 00:18:36,660
(I can't drag you into this danger.)

275
00:18:40,540 --> 00:18:40,940
(Your Highness,)

276
00:18:42,900 --> 00:18:44,380
(do you want Meng Zaishi dead?)

277
00:18:46,420 --> 00:18:47,780
(I'll find a way to make it happen.)

278
00:18:50,180 --> 00:18:50,900
(Those hands of yours)

279
00:18:52,420 --> 00:18:53,900
(should never have to do that again.)

280
00:19:14,620 --> 00:19:15,500
Forgive us, Your Royal Highness.

281
00:19:15,940 --> 00:19:17,260
We couldn't see the Princess.

282
00:19:17,460 --> 00:19:18,540
We were turned away.

283
00:19:31,700 --> 00:19:33,740
You drank plenty at the banquet.

284
00:19:34,700 --> 00:19:35,060
What?

285
00:19:35,900 --> 00:19:36,860
Planning to drink yourself
into a stupor again?

286
00:19:45,820 --> 00:19:47,220
Before she left for North Jing,

287
00:19:48,900 --> 00:19:50,140
we told each other everything.

288
00:19:50,780 --> 00:19:52,020
Then we spent three years apart.

289
00:19:52,900 --> 00:19:53,660
When we met again,

290
00:19:55,700 --> 00:19:57,060
she didn't say a word

291
00:19:57,540 --> 00:19:58,500
about what happened in North Jing.

292
00:20:03,980 --> 00:20:05,740
It's not just that she no longer
wants to marry me.

293
00:20:07,100 --> 00:20:09,060
She doesn't even see me
as a friend anymore.

294
00:20:09,980 --> 00:20:11,060
And it took me until today

295
00:20:11,820 --> 00:20:12,620
to realize that.

296
00:20:18,140 --> 00:20:19,100
You're reading too much into it.

297
00:20:19,980 --> 00:20:20,780
If she really

298
00:20:21,820 --> 00:20:22,940
went through something like that,

299
00:20:24,020 --> 00:20:25,420
of course she wouldn't
want to tell her friends and family.

300
00:20:29,700 --> 00:20:30,140
Since she won't let

301
00:20:30,700 --> 00:20:31,940
the imperial physicians near her,

302
00:20:33,460 --> 00:20:34,060
I think

303
00:20:35,020 --> 00:20:35,820
I have my answer.

304
00:20:37,380 --> 00:20:37,740
Yang Si,

305
00:20:38,140 --> 00:20:40,100
go to her residence tomorrow.

306
00:20:40,740 --> 00:20:42,620
Find out everything you can about this.

307
00:20:50,900 --> 00:20:51,380
Your Highness,

308
00:20:57,180 --> 00:20:58,420
you're even more heartless

309
00:21:00,140 --> 00:21:01,500
than I thought.

310
00:21:07,340 --> 00:21:08,940
You and I may not believe
the prophecy about her,

311
00:21:09,820 --> 00:21:10,940
but plenty of others do.

312
00:21:11,940 --> 00:21:13,580
Whether she can bear a future ruler

313
00:21:14,780 --> 00:21:16,060
matters to a great many people.

314
00:21:16,340 --> 00:21:17,780
The fate of the empire is at stake.

315
00:21:18,380 --> 00:21:19,620
Why are you getting so worked up?

316
00:21:20,580 --> 00:21:21,460
Stop playing the devoted lover.

317
00:21:24,340 --> 00:21:25,620
She's your sister, for God's sake!

318
00:21:41,620 --> 00:21:42,340
As...

319
00:21:43,300 --> 00:21:43,900
you command,

320
00:21:46,580 --> 00:21:47,060
Your Royal Highness.

321
00:21:51,380 --> 00:21:53,780
(Hongwen Hall;
Pursuit of Wisdom; Quiet Contemplation)

322
00:22:08,020 --> 00:22:10,580
(Shi, Xun, Yu, Qing)

323
00:22:11,580 --> 00:22:12,780
(Of all these people,)

324
00:22:13,620 --> 00:22:14,980
(I suspect only Meng Zaishi)

325
00:22:14,980 --> 00:22:16,780
(truly has his heart set on that deer.)

326
00:22:17,700 --> 00:22:20,620
(Shi)

327
00:22:22,220 --> 00:22:24,060
(Qing)

328
00:22:24,060 --> 00:22:25,100
(Mu Xianqing.)

329
00:22:26,020 --> 00:22:27,140
(Would he rather claim the deer,)

330
00:22:28,020 --> 00:22:30,180
(or take Meng Zaishi's life?)

331
00:22:31,180 --> 00:22:32,780
(Shi, Xun, Yu, Qing)
(Which would please him more?)

332
00:22:34,380 --> 00:22:35,620
(Qiu Shuo joined the hunt)

333
00:22:36,140 --> 00:22:37,580
(on Yu Cheng'an's orders.)

334
00:22:38,700 --> 00:22:40,380
(What exactly is Yu Cheng'an planning?)

335
00:22:41,580 --> 00:22:42,340
(Could it be...)

336
00:22:43,260 --> 00:22:44,540
(The Crown Prince might be in danger?)

337
00:22:46,780 --> 00:22:48,140
(But why would the Crown Prince)

338
00:22:48,140 --> 00:22:49,700
(volunteer to take part?)

339
00:22:51,180 --> 00:22:52,700
(He's always kept his abilities hidden)

340
00:22:53,420 --> 00:22:55,740
(and never dared show his strength
before Lord Yu.)

341
00:22:57,460 --> 00:22:58,660
(Why step into the spotlight now?)

342
00:23:00,580 --> 00:23:02,220
(Xun)
(What's he really after?)

343
00:23:06,660 --> 00:23:09,180
(Shi, Xun, Yu, Qing)

344
00:23:10,940 --> 00:23:11,300
Yan Shang.

345
00:23:11,300 --> 00:23:12,020
(Shi, Xun, Yu, Qing)

346
00:23:13,540 --> 00:23:13,820
What...

347
00:23:14,460 --> 00:23:15,260
are you writing?

348
00:23:18,100 --> 00:23:18,860
(Shi, Xun, Yu, Qing)
Aren't these

349
00:23:19,340 --> 00:23:21,260
the most powerful figures
at court right now?

350
00:23:22,940 --> 00:23:25,220
You can't just write
their names down like that!

351
00:23:27,140 --> 00:23:29,180
I was thinking about tomorrow's
winter hunt.

352
00:23:29,580 --> 00:23:31,060
We're accompanying His Majesty,

353
00:23:31,780 --> 00:23:32,780
and these powerful men

354
00:23:32,980 --> 00:23:34,220
are usually way out of our reach.

355
00:23:34,820 --> 00:23:36,940
If I could bring a gift
and use this opportunity,

356
00:23:37,660 --> 00:23:39,700
which one should I approach?

357
00:23:40,980 --> 00:23:41,380
Cui Ren,

358
00:23:41,900 --> 00:23:42,820
give me some advice.

359
00:23:45,220 --> 00:23:46,180
You're getting ahead of yourself.

360
00:23:47,220 --> 00:23:50,260
They search you from head to toe
before you enter the hunting grounds.

361
00:23:50,340 --> 00:23:51,740
They even check inside your topknot.

362
00:23:51,780 --> 00:23:52,940
You won't get anything past them.

363
00:23:54,700 --> 00:23:55,420
Besides,

364
00:23:56,020 --> 00:23:56,580
these men

365
00:23:57,300 --> 00:23:59,620
are all far too powerful for us
to cozy up to.

366
00:24:02,660 --> 00:24:03,380
Then again,

367
00:24:04,540 --> 00:24:05,500
you're different.

368
00:24:06,500 --> 00:24:08,540
Why not use your connections
with Princess Danyang?

369
00:24:10,580 --> 00:24:11,300
Cui Ren...

370
00:24:13,060 --> 00:24:13,740
Look at you.

371
00:24:14,140 --> 00:24:15,220
You've already got every advantage,

372
00:24:15,700 --> 00:24:17,460
yet you're still racking your brains
to advance your career.

373
00:24:17,820 --> 00:24:19,980
How are the rest of us, just collecting
our salaries, supposed to get by?

374
00:24:33,540 --> 00:24:34,300
You don't have to feel awkward.

375
00:24:36,660 --> 00:24:37,540
I'll tell you myself.

376
00:24:40,100 --> 00:24:40,980
What Meng said

377
00:24:41,500 --> 00:24:42,100
was all true.

378
00:24:43,860 --> 00:24:44,380
Wanyao...

379
00:24:46,220 --> 00:24:47,500
Now you know everything.

380
00:24:48,100 --> 00:24:48,620
You can leave.

381
00:24:51,500 --> 00:24:52,580
I have a question of my own.

382
00:24:56,620 --> 00:24:57,460
If I claim the deer,

383
00:24:59,340 --> 00:25:00,420
who would you want to belong to?

384
00:25:01,340 --> 00:25:02,620
I only want to belong to myself.

385
00:25:06,580 --> 00:25:07,260
When it comes to archery and riding,

386
00:25:08,220 --> 00:25:09,300
even against Meng Zaishi,

387
00:25:09,900 --> 00:25:10,900
I'd still stand a chance.

388
00:25:12,460 --> 00:25:12,980
Don't worry.

389
00:25:13,820 --> 00:25:14,620
I'll help you. I promise.

390
00:25:19,100 --> 00:25:19,700
Your Highness!

391
00:25:24,660 --> 00:25:26,020
Yang Si, you're here too!

392
00:25:28,180 --> 00:25:28,580
Zhi.

393
00:25:30,780 --> 00:25:31,580
What's the dog for?

394
00:25:32,420 --> 00:25:33,460
I asked her to come.

395
00:25:35,740 --> 00:25:37,020
I've brought Your Highness
a prized hunting dog

396
00:25:37,100 --> 00:25:37,780
to help you hunt the deer.

397
00:25:39,420 --> 00:25:40,100
Lingfei,

398
00:25:40,980 --> 00:25:43,060
thank you for standing up for me
at the birthday banquet.

399
00:25:43,420 --> 00:25:45,220
And now you've come to my rescue again.

400
00:25:46,220 --> 00:25:46,940
I just couldn't stand

401
00:25:46,940 --> 00:25:48,140
that brutish soldier from North Jing.

402
00:25:48,500 --> 00:25:49,860
I just spoke up in the heat
of the moment.

403
00:25:50,180 --> 00:25:51,300
I've always been quick to speak my mind.

404
00:25:51,500 --> 00:25:52,340
I hardly did anything.

405
00:25:52,580 --> 00:25:53,420
Please don't mention it again,
Your Highness.

406
00:25:54,740 --> 00:25:55,180
Zhi.

407
00:25:55,980 --> 00:25:56,300
Sniff.

408
00:26:00,140 --> 00:26:00,700
Here's some dried meat.

409
00:26:01,860 --> 00:26:02,300
Zhi.

410
00:26:07,700 --> 00:26:08,060
Go on.

411
00:26:20,060 --> 00:26:21,220
I found this forehead ornament
when I came in.

412
00:26:21,500 --> 00:26:22,660
Looks like it belongs to this lady.

413
00:26:23,340 --> 00:26:23,980
Here you go.

414
00:26:27,020 --> 00:26:27,740
Thank you, Miss.

415
00:26:33,020 --> 00:26:33,940
Is there a way

416
00:26:34,460 --> 00:26:36,580
to keep Zhi from rushing
straight at a target,

417
00:26:37,100 --> 00:26:39,260
and have her follow at a distance

418
00:26:39,620 --> 00:26:40,620
without the prey noticing?

419
00:26:41,100 --> 00:26:41,740
You mean tracking?

420
00:26:42,260 --> 00:26:43,620
Then give her this command.

421
00:26:44,740 --> 00:26:45,060
Track!

422
00:26:46,260 --> 00:26:46,580
Track!

423
00:26:49,420 --> 00:26:50,900
Lingfei, thank you so much.

424
00:26:52,100 --> 00:26:54,940
I heard Lord Yu arranged
for the deer and golden bell.

425
00:26:55,540 --> 00:26:57,060
They've already been taken
to the hunting grounds.

426
00:26:57,420 --> 00:26:57,820
Your Highness,

427
00:26:58,140 --> 00:26:58,620
Yang Si,

428
00:26:59,140 --> 00:27:00,180
could you two get

429
00:27:00,180 --> 00:27:01,500
some droppings from that deer?

430
00:27:02,100 --> 00:27:02,820
A few hairs would work too.

431
00:27:03,620 --> 00:27:04,700
Or failing that,

432
00:27:04,940 --> 00:27:06,060
even some straw from its pen.

433
00:27:06,620 --> 00:27:07,180
No problem.

434
00:27:08,180 --> 00:27:08,460
Here.

435
00:27:21,020 --> 00:27:21,580
Stop!

436
00:27:23,260 --> 00:27:23,660
Mr. Chen.

437
00:27:25,340 --> 00:27:26,380
Oh, it's you, Wenji.

438
00:27:27,660 --> 00:27:28,620
What brings you here?

439
00:27:29,740 --> 00:27:31,860
This is a special Golden Bell Crisp
from the Imperial Cuisine Service.

440
00:27:32,420 --> 00:27:33,900
I was ordered to deliver it to Lord Yu.

441
00:27:53,460 --> 00:27:55,140
Could you present it to him for me?

442
00:27:55,620 --> 00:27:56,100
That would be just as good.

443
00:28:05,060 --> 00:28:05,940
Why'd you spill it?

444
00:28:06,540 --> 00:28:07,580
You clumsy fool!

445
00:28:07,580 --> 00:28:08,460
Clean it up, now!

446
00:28:08,740 --> 00:28:10,500
If you get Lord Yu's shoes dirty,

447
00:28:10,780 --> 00:28:11,660
you'll pay for it!

448
00:28:33,300 --> 00:28:35,260
How are things
with the Prince of Jin lately?

449
00:28:36,460 --> 00:28:37,220
Everything is as usual.

450
00:28:39,980 --> 00:28:42,620
Is his secondary consort's
pregnancy progressing well?

451
00:28:44,220 --> 00:28:47,220
The imperial physician checks her pulse
every ten days.

452
00:28:48,780 --> 00:28:52,220
But there have been unusual developments
at the Eastern Palace lately.

453
00:28:53,300 --> 00:28:53,780
Who's there?

454
00:28:56,460 --> 00:28:57,020
Lord Yu,

455
00:28:58,340 --> 00:29:00,340
I was only here by chance.

456
00:29:00,620 --> 00:29:01,660
I never meant to eavesdrop.

457
00:29:03,140 --> 00:29:03,980
But just now,

458
00:29:04,140 --> 00:29:06,100
I did overhear you and Mr. Wei.

459
00:29:06,580 --> 00:29:07,340
I won't deny it.

460
00:29:08,220 --> 00:29:09,100
I know I deserve to die.

461
00:29:09,820 --> 00:29:10,860
I leave my fate in your hands.

462
00:29:27,500 --> 00:29:27,900
Enough.

463
00:29:28,460 --> 00:29:28,860
Stop trembling.

464
00:29:30,060 --> 00:29:31,620
If I wanted you dead,
you'd be dead already.

465
00:29:33,740 --> 00:29:37,860
(Hidden Talent and Virtue)

466
00:29:39,860 --> 00:29:40,500
Thank you, Lord Yu.

467
00:29:41,300 --> 00:29:42,220
You're a man

468
00:29:43,860 --> 00:29:44,460
of learning,

469
00:29:45,460 --> 00:29:46,540
and you're quick-witted.

470
00:29:47,500 --> 00:29:48,580
But understand this.

471
00:29:48,980 --> 00:29:50,780
To survive here,

472
00:29:51,220 --> 00:29:52,420
you must listen more and talk less.

473
00:29:53,220 --> 00:29:55,020
That's how you'll secure your future.

474
00:29:56,540 --> 00:29:58,340
I'll take your advice to heart, Lord Yu.

475
00:29:59,660 --> 00:30:01,580
My lips will be sealed.

476
00:30:12,260 --> 00:30:12,580
Lord Yu.

477
00:30:14,220 --> 00:30:15,380
Chen Lian

478
00:30:16,100 --> 00:30:17,180
has always been a bully.

479
00:30:18,020 --> 00:30:18,820
Don't dwell

480
00:30:19,780 --> 00:30:20,540
on what happened tonight.

481
00:30:22,580 --> 00:30:24,380
I'm fortunate to have your favor,
Lord Yu.

482
00:30:25,740 --> 00:30:26,540
Things like this

483
00:30:27,740 --> 00:30:28,420
are bound to happen.

484
00:30:29,860 --> 00:30:30,820
You know,

485
00:30:33,620 --> 00:30:36,020
eunuchs have all had hard lives.

486
00:30:37,540 --> 00:30:38,780
(Hidden Talent and Virtue)
Those who've suffered

487
00:30:40,260 --> 00:30:43,100
shouldn't look down on
or undermine one another.

488
00:30:43,780 --> 00:30:44,900
But you must understand,

489
00:30:45,980 --> 00:30:46,860
how many people

490
00:30:47,420 --> 00:30:48,660
can truly live by that?

491
00:30:51,460 --> 00:30:52,100
I understand, Lord Yu.

492
00:30:54,980 --> 00:30:57,460
Have you ever thought about leaving
the Imperial Cuisine Service?

493
00:31:00,860 --> 00:31:02,260
Whether I can leave there

494
00:31:02,700 --> 00:31:03,940
is entirely up to you, Lord Yu.

495
00:31:04,460 --> 00:31:04,940
Since

496
00:31:05,540 --> 00:31:06,580
you haven't given the word yet,

497
00:31:07,460 --> 00:31:08,180
I...

498
00:31:10,500 --> 00:31:11,540
I would venture to guess

499
00:31:12,140 --> 00:31:13,100
that you wish to

500
00:31:13,460 --> 00:31:14,820
test and train me further.

501
00:31:20,980 --> 00:31:22,220
I remember you telling me

502
00:31:22,780 --> 00:31:23,620
that you once

503
00:31:24,380 --> 00:31:26,100
planned to take
the imperial examinations.

504
00:31:27,220 --> 00:31:28,420
But something happened,

505
00:31:29,100 --> 00:31:30,420
and you became a eunuch instead.

506
00:31:31,100 --> 00:31:31,900
What happened?

507
00:31:33,060 --> 00:31:33,820
Your family fell on hard times?

508
00:31:46,260 --> 00:31:46,620
One day,

509
00:31:48,420 --> 00:31:49,660
I came across a young woman

510
00:31:50,380 --> 00:31:51,220
being bullied by a thug.

511
00:31:52,700 --> 00:31:53,380
I couldn't stand it,

512
00:31:54,580 --> 00:31:55,380
so I stepped in to reason with him.

513
00:31:57,260 --> 00:31:58,300
But the thug

514
00:31:59,260 --> 00:32:00,500
attacked me with a knife
and mutilated me.

515
00:32:03,060 --> 00:32:04,060
Was the attacker

516
00:32:04,740 --> 00:32:06,140
brought to justice?

517
00:32:07,380 --> 00:32:07,780
Yes, Lord Yu.

518
00:32:09,220 --> 00:32:09,820
Justice caught up with him.

519
00:32:10,540 --> 00:32:10,940
That man

520
00:32:11,580 --> 00:32:12,900
got what he deserved.

521
00:32:13,940 --> 00:32:15,860
You certainly have a noble heart.

522
00:32:19,180 --> 00:32:19,460
No.

523
00:32:21,260 --> 00:32:22,060
It wasn't because

524
00:32:22,740 --> 00:32:23,580
I'm particularly noble.

525
00:32:26,580 --> 00:32:27,820
It's just that the woman's name

526
00:32:28,940 --> 00:32:30,740
sounded like the name of someone I love.

527
00:32:32,940 --> 00:32:34,820
Hearing that thug harassing the lady
with that name,

528
00:32:35,940 --> 00:32:38,380
I just couldn't swallow my anger.

529
00:32:43,700 --> 00:32:45,100
Now that you're a eunuch,

530
00:32:46,140 --> 00:32:47,620
that's all in the past.

531
00:32:48,780 --> 00:32:49,260
Let it go.

532
00:32:50,180 --> 00:32:51,980
I imagine the woman you loved

533
00:32:52,540 --> 00:32:54,460
must have found someone else by now.

534
00:33:03,580 --> 00:33:04,900
Whether I'd become a eunuch or not,

535
00:33:07,300 --> 00:33:08,420
she already belonged to another man.

536
00:33:10,980 --> 00:33:11,940
The woman I love

537
00:33:13,540 --> 00:33:14,460
has always been

538
00:33:16,540 --> 00:33:17,820
of a different social standing than me.

539
00:33:27,540 --> 00:33:27,980
Wang Qing!

540
00:33:31,100 --> 00:33:31,580
Yes, my lord.

541
00:33:32,300 --> 00:33:33,420
Go to the Imperial Cuisine Service

542
00:33:33,980 --> 00:33:34,660
and tell them

543
00:33:35,780 --> 00:33:37,180
Liu Wenji won't be returning.

544
00:33:37,820 --> 00:33:38,180
Yes, my lord.

545
00:33:42,300 --> 00:33:47,220
(Hidden Talent and Virtue)

546
00:33:50,700 --> 00:33:52,460
You'll accompany me to serve
at tomorrow's hunt.

547
00:34:01,700 --> 00:34:02,060
I...

548
00:34:02,660 --> 00:34:04,060
I'm deeply grateful for your promotion,
Lord Yu!

549
00:34:12,460 --> 00:34:12,980
You may go.

550
00:34:16,060 --> 00:34:16,620
I'll take my leave.

551
00:34:16,940 --> 00:34:23,840
(Hidden Talent and Virtue)

552
00:34:44,940 --> 00:34:48,460
(30 Years Ago)

553
00:34:48,460 --> 00:34:49,500
(Luhua Hall)
Go tell my brother, the Emperor,

554
00:34:49,860 --> 00:34:50,580
if he's going to keep me locked up here,

555
00:34:50,580 --> 00:34:51,700
I might as well be dead!

556
00:34:58,220 --> 00:34:58,860
Don't do it, Your Highness!

557
00:34:59,540 --> 00:35:00,180
Don't, Your Highness!

558
00:35:07,500 --> 00:35:10,860
(Mu Ningshuang,
Young Grand Princess of Luling)

559
00:35:10,860 --> 00:35:11,300
Who are you?

560
00:35:11,700 --> 00:35:12,540
Why haven't I seen you before?

561
00:35:13,820 --> 00:35:14,940
I'm Yu Cheng'an, Your Highness.

562
00:35:15,740 --> 00:35:17,660
(Young Yu Cheng'an)
I used to feed your horses.

563
00:35:18,420 --> 00:35:19,580
You wouldn't have seen me.

564
00:35:21,420 --> 00:35:22,180
Unbelievable!

565
00:35:23,140 --> 00:35:24,820
They promised to leave me someone
to serve me,

566
00:35:25,100 --> 00:35:26,580
yet they sent me a stable boy!

567
00:35:27,220 --> 00:35:28,420
What do they take me for?

568
00:35:28,980 --> 00:35:30,260
I might as well be dead!

569
00:35:30,260 --> 00:35:31,180
Your Highness! Please!

570
00:35:31,420 --> 00:35:31,700
Your Highness!

571
00:35:32,380 --> 00:35:32,700
Your Highness!

572
00:35:35,540 --> 00:35:36,220
Are you stupid?

573
00:35:37,460 --> 00:35:37,940
You don't get it.

574
00:35:39,180 --> 00:35:39,740
If I'm going to make a scene,

575
00:35:39,980 --> 00:35:41,220
there needs to be some blood.

576
00:35:42,180 --> 00:35:43,460
Once my brother hears about it,

577
00:35:43,660 --> 00:35:44,700
he won't dare keep me locked up.

578
00:35:52,460 --> 00:35:53,340
Actually,

579
00:35:54,020 --> 00:35:54,980
maybe I should just kill you.

580
00:35:56,780 --> 00:35:57,420
That way,

581
00:35:57,860 --> 00:35:58,700
if someone ends up dead,

582
00:35:59,380 --> 00:36:00,500
my brother wouldn't possibly

583
00:36:00,500 --> 00:36:02,060
keep me locked up with a corpse.

584
00:36:02,820 --> 00:36:03,460
Don't you think?

585
00:36:19,660 --> 00:36:20,100
What a bore.

586
00:36:21,300 --> 00:36:22,380
I'm only a lowly servant.

587
00:36:22,740 --> 00:36:25,060
Better to hurt me than yourself,
Your Highness.

588
00:36:29,100 --> 00:36:30,900
You really are an idiot.

589
00:36:32,100 --> 00:36:32,820
You thought I meant it?

590
00:36:36,980 --> 00:36:38,420
All those noblemen

591
00:36:38,940 --> 00:36:40,420
have beautiful women fawning over them.

592
00:36:41,620 --> 00:36:43,500
All I did was go to a music house

593
00:36:43,660 --> 00:36:45,460
and fool around
with a few pretty-boy musicians.

594
00:36:46,260 --> 00:36:46,900
And look what happened.

595
00:36:47,660 --> 00:36:48,900
I ended up locked away like this.

596
00:36:50,220 --> 00:36:51,780
If I actually killed you,

597
00:36:52,460 --> 00:36:53,780
my self-righteous brother

598
00:36:54,060 --> 00:36:55,900
would probably send even more people
to watch me.

599
00:36:56,540 --> 00:36:57,780
Then I'd never get out!

600
00:37:01,540 --> 00:37:02,420
Three months.

601
00:37:04,140 --> 00:37:06,180
I'll lose my mind being locked up
that long!

602
00:37:07,100 --> 00:37:08,140
I'm sure you'll get through

603
00:37:08,620 --> 00:37:10,100
the three months safely, Your Highness.

604
00:37:10,980 --> 00:37:11,820
I may be clumsy,

605
00:37:12,380 --> 00:37:14,140
but I'll do everything I can
to serve you.

606
00:37:33,700 --> 00:37:35,380
You can spit it into my hand,
Your Highness.

607
00:37:38,500 --> 00:37:39,020
Stable boy,

608
00:37:39,780 --> 00:37:41,460
what did you say your name was again?

609
00:37:42,660 --> 00:37:43,980
Yu Cheng'an, Your Highness.

610
00:37:47,780 --> 00:37:49,900
Seeing that meek little face
of yours every day,

611
00:37:51,140 --> 00:37:53,100
hearing "Your Highness" all day...

612
00:37:53,940 --> 00:37:55,420
I'm sick of hearing it!

613
00:37:59,140 --> 00:37:59,540
Yu Cheng'an,

614
00:38:00,900 --> 00:38:03,020
today, I'm allowing you to call me
by my name.

615
00:38:04,420 --> 00:38:05,100
I wouldn't dare.

616
00:38:05,580 --> 00:38:06,980
You dare disobey my orders?

617
00:38:09,580 --> 00:38:11,980
But I don't even know your name,
Your Highness.

618
00:38:15,020 --> 00:38:15,500
Ningshuang.

619
00:38:16,620 --> 00:38:18,180
My name is Mu Ningshuang.

620
00:38:18,780 --> 00:38:19,220
Go ahead. Say it.

621
00:38:26,420 --> 00:38:31,820
Mu... Ningshuang.

622
00:38:32,540 --> 00:38:33,140
Can you read?

623
00:38:35,260 --> 00:38:37,380
Then you surely haven't read
Ruan Ji's poetry.

624
00:38:38,260 --> 00:38:38,620
No, I haven't.

625
00:38:40,460 --> 00:38:42,380
"Thick frost blankets the wild grass,

626
00:38:42,780 --> 00:38:44,860
as the year draws to its end."

627
00:38:48,420 --> 00:38:50,900
"Thick frost

628
00:38:51,340 --> 00:38:52,580
blankets the wild grass..."

629
00:38:55,540 --> 00:38:56,820
You wouldn't understand it anyway.

630
00:38:57,620 --> 00:38:58,500
Just remember,

631
00:38:58,940 --> 00:38:59,740
the wild grass

632
00:38:59,900 --> 00:39:02,260
means lowly people like you.

633
00:39:03,660 --> 00:39:04,580
I'll remember that.

634
00:39:08,940 --> 00:39:09,460
Stable boy,

635
00:39:11,260 --> 00:39:12,500
you've never tasted this before,
have you?

636
00:39:48,420 --> 00:39:49,420
Three months...

637
00:39:51,940 --> 00:39:52,980
Three months...

638
00:39:54,060 --> 00:39:56,660
When is this misery going to end?

639
00:40:03,740 --> 00:40:04,220
Yu Cheng'an.

640
00:40:04,900 --> 00:40:05,660
Get over here!

641
00:40:06,900 --> 00:40:07,900
I'm bored out of my mind.

642
00:40:08,460 --> 00:40:10,180
How about I teach you to read?

643
00:40:15,660 --> 00:40:16,060
Sir.

644
00:40:25,540 --> 00:40:26,300
(Why did Yu Cheng'an)

645
00:40:27,020 --> 00:40:28,860
(specifically ask about Chunhua?)

646
00:40:31,220 --> 00:40:33,260
(Why is he so concerned
about her unborn child?)

647
00:40:34,460 --> 00:40:35,860
(And he even mentioned
the Crown Prince.)

648
00:40:38,700 --> 00:40:39,820
(What does any of this)

649
00:40:40,660 --> 00:40:42,060
(have to do with the Crown Prince?)

650
00:40:48,340 --> 00:40:49,460
Mr. Liu

651
00:40:49,580 --> 00:40:50,820
certainly has a way with words.

652
00:40:51,540 --> 00:40:53,020
No wonder he's caught your eye.

653
00:40:55,140 --> 00:40:55,980
But...

654
00:40:56,500 --> 00:40:57,900
he overheard our conversation.

655
00:40:58,660 --> 00:40:59,300
Won't that be a problem?

656
00:40:59,660 --> 00:41:00,060
Not at all.

657
00:41:01,540 --> 00:41:03,140
From the start of tomorrow's winter hunt

658
00:41:03,620 --> 00:41:04,340
until it ends,

659
00:41:04,980 --> 00:41:06,780
I won't let him out of my sight.

660
00:41:07,420 --> 00:41:08,100
Besides,

661
00:41:09,100 --> 00:41:11,980
with every faction vying for power,
we need capable people.

662
00:41:12,340 --> 00:41:13,060
I believe

663
00:41:14,140 --> 00:41:16,500
he has real potential.

664
00:41:19,340 --> 00:41:21,580
Losing Mr. Zheng was like
losing your right hand.

665
00:41:22,460 --> 00:41:23,380
Someone needs

666
00:41:24,140 --> 00:41:25,740
to fill the void he left.

667
00:41:27,060 --> 00:41:30,020
(Wangchun Wine)

668
00:41:45,500 --> 00:41:46,620
What brings you here,
Your Royal Highness?

669
00:41:49,820 --> 00:41:50,420
I came to see you.

670
00:41:52,380 --> 00:41:54,020
Your Royal Highness gracing
such a humble place?

671
00:41:54,420 --> 00:41:55,340
I'm hardly worthy of the honor.

672
00:41:57,540 --> 00:41:58,540
I looked into it for you.

673
00:41:58,940 --> 00:42:00,060
What Meng Zaishi said

674
00:42:01,020 --> 00:42:01,620
was true.

675
00:42:05,660 --> 00:42:06,740
Is there anything else you need?

676
00:42:07,500 --> 00:42:08,620
Just give me your orders.

677
00:42:24,100 --> 00:42:24,740
Put your boots on.

678
00:42:25,580 --> 00:42:26,340
I'm taking you somewhere.

679
00:42:28,860 --> 00:42:29,620
There are things

680
00:42:30,660 --> 00:42:31,740
I've kept from you all this time.

681
00:42:32,420 --> 00:42:33,020
But I promise,

682
00:42:34,020 --> 00:42:34,700
after tonight,

683
00:42:35,580 --> 00:42:36,620
I won't hide anything from you again.

684
00:42:39,820 --> 00:42:40,220
Yang Si,

685
00:42:41,740 --> 00:42:42,260
come with me.

686
00:42:51,420 --> 00:42:53,100
What are we doing here so late?

687
00:42:54,020 --> 00:42:55,460
We've already kept our
special guest waiting long enough.

688
00:42:56,180 --> 00:42:56,660
Special guest?

689
00:43:21,780 --> 00:43:24,500
Tomorrow's weather looks perfect
for hunting.

690
00:43:33,820 --> 00:43:34,660
Don't worry.

691
00:43:35,620 --> 00:43:37,820
I've rarely missed my target
since I was little.

692
00:43:38,580 --> 00:43:39,420
I'm really good, you know.

693
00:43:43,820 --> 00:43:44,300
I know.

694
00:43:45,260 --> 00:43:46,180
You're very good.

695
00:43:47,740 --> 00:43:49,740
I might not be able to keep up
with you on horseback tomorrow.

696
00:43:50,140 --> 00:43:51,380
Why would you need to keep up with me?

697
00:43:52,540 --> 00:43:53,420
Weapons are dangerous.

698
00:43:53,740 --> 00:43:54,980
I won't have time to protect you.

699
00:43:55,980 --> 00:43:56,900
Tomorrow,

700
00:43:57,700 --> 00:43:59,220
you stay in the rest tent

701
00:44:00,060 --> 00:44:00,700
and wait for my triumphant return.

702
00:44:02,980 --> 00:44:03,500
Wanyao,

703
00:44:04,820 --> 00:44:05,700
besides you,

704
00:44:06,780 --> 00:44:08,300
if the Crown Prince,

705
00:44:08,660 --> 00:44:10,220
Yang Si, or Zhao Lingfei
claims the deer,

706
00:44:10,700 --> 00:44:11,740
things might still turn out well.

707
00:44:12,980 --> 00:44:13,500
But if the deer

708
00:44:14,380 --> 00:44:15,180
ends up in the hands of

709
00:44:16,300 --> 00:44:17,940
Qiu Shuo or Mu Xianqing,

710
00:44:18,900 --> 00:44:20,540
it may be no better
than Meng Zaishi winning.

711
00:44:22,380 --> 00:44:23,460
At best, the odds

712
00:44:23,980 --> 00:44:25,140
are four to three in our favor.

713
00:44:27,420 --> 00:44:28,820
And that's being optimistic.

714
00:44:30,340 --> 00:44:31,300
In this gamble,

715
00:44:32,300 --> 00:44:33,940
all seven of us want different things,

716
00:44:34,780 --> 00:44:36,100
and none of us is guaranteed
to get what we want.

717
00:44:37,940 --> 00:44:38,900
The only one running the game

718
00:44:39,740 --> 00:44:40,860
is the man who releases the deer.

719
00:44:46,780 --> 00:44:48,060
But maybe that's a good thing.

720
00:44:48,980 --> 00:44:50,460
To him, I'm no more than an insect.

721
00:44:51,220 --> 00:44:52,540
With such a grand event tomorrow,

722
00:44:53,340 --> 00:44:54,740
he'll have bigger things on his mind.

723
00:44:55,900 --> 00:44:58,140
He won't go out of his way to target me.

724
00:44:59,820 --> 00:45:01,100
Please be very careful tomorrow.

725
00:45:02,980 --> 00:45:05,500
♪As if our love will never fade♪

726
00:45:05,500 --> 00:45:06,740
Tomorrow isn't even here yet,

727
00:45:07,780 --> 00:45:09,060
and you're already
worrying yourself sick.

728
00:45:10,580 --> 00:45:11,780
Haven't you heard

729
00:45:12,100 --> 00:45:13,460
the saying

730
00:45:13,460 --> 00:45:15,820
that every moment of a night like this
is precious?

731
00:45:22,140 --> 00:45:26,780
(Next Episode Preview)

732
00:45:27,460 --> 00:45:28,500
Your Highness,

733
00:45:29,100 --> 00:45:29,940
sooner or later,

734
00:45:30,780 --> 00:45:32,300
I'll make you look at me
the way you used to,

735
00:45:33,420 --> 00:45:35,100
with tenderness in your eyes,

736
00:45:36,140 --> 00:45:36,900
begging me.

737
00:45:39,700 --> 00:45:40,580
Just you wait.

738
00:45:43,441 --> 00:45:46,734
♪Be the ferry
where you wait for the sun♪

739
00:45:49,419 --> 00:45:54,335
♪Be the blue silk
that catches your tears♪

740
00:45:56,529 --> 00:46:02,374
♪Be the sleeve we held,
worn by dust and years♪

741
00:46:02,874 --> 00:46:08,100
♪Let's conspire to grow old together♪

742
00:46:10,869 --> 00:46:15,660
♪Let me be a captive beast
bound by the same lock as you♪

743
00:46:16,496 --> 00:46:22,575
♪- Through trails of mud and blood;
- let grief drown in your eyes♪

744
00:46:24,376 --> 00:46:27,526
♪Soar with the wind;
plunge into hellfire as one♪

745
00:46:27,526 --> 00:46:29,174
♪Burning bright as a song♪

746
00:46:29,226 --> 00:46:32,950
♪See how roses and green bamboo enchant♪

747
00:46:33,328 --> 00:46:37,994
♪Be the vow I make with all my heart♪

748
00:46:38,613 --> 00:46:42,654
♪If we say forever,
then forever it shall be♪

749
00:46:43,145 --> 00:46:45,260
♪Not a single hour less♪

750
00:46:45,300 --> 00:46:52,246
♪However deep the snow,
I'll wait if you're there♪

751
00:46:53,009 --> 00:46:56,462
♪We'll be gods above,
or wandering souls♪

752
00:46:56,642 --> 00:46:59,787
♪In heaven or the underworld,
you're all I need♪

753
00:47:00,226 --> 00:47:06,863
♪If we can stay, let's return
to the village of our first meeting♪

754
00:47:07,260 --> 00:47:09,298
♪- May time be free of fear;
- boats rock♪

755
00:47:09,298 --> 00:47:11,774
♪- May time be free of pain;
- lights fade, seasons turn♪

756
00:47:11,812 --> 00:47:14,281
♪You're the only one I need♪

757
00:47:14,485 --> 00:47:21,372
♪Sharp winds or fierce rain,
nothing can break us♪

758
00:47:21,684 --> 00:47:24,955
♪Be mine in this world;
be mine in this life♪

759
00:47:25,260 --> 00:47:28,433
♪My last untouched innocence♪

760
00:47:28,757 --> 00:47:32,183
♪If only we could return
to the village where we first met♪

761
00:47:32,416 --> 00:47:35,641
♪Stay by me; help me forget
the frozen dream of last night♪

762
00:47:35,972 --> 00:47:42,768
♪Fireflies glow, flowers kiss our lips;
just us, through dawn and dusk♪

763
00:47:43,137 --> 00:47:45,199
♪- May time be free of fear;
- boats rock♪

764
00:47:45,200 --> 00:47:47,703
♪- May time be free of pain;
- lights fade, seasons turn♪

765
00:47:47,750 --> 00:47:50,088
♪You're the only one I need♪

766
00:47:50,319 --> 00:47:57,154
♪By your side, through joy and pain,
is that eternity?♪

767
00:47:57,503 --> 00:47:59,121
♪Till fireworks flood the town♪

768
00:47:59,251 --> 00:48:01,047
♪Till the lake is still and clear♪

769
00:48:01,404 --> 00:48:04,421
♪You're the only one I need♪

770
00:48:04,461 --> 00:48:05,788
(No animals were harmed
or mistreated in production.)

